==Description==
'''BBQ Pyromancer 👍''', internally just '''BBQ Pyromancer''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It is obtained from Level 23 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{BeachBalls|1,450}} or {{Robux|100}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|8,210}} or {{Robux|1,604}}. his item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|126}} with a total cost of {{Robux|2,017}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a cost of {{Robux|76}}, with a total cost of {{Robux|1,642}}.

==Appearance==
'''BBQ Pyromancer 👍''' showcases a Level 5 {{Color|EndOfSummer|Barbecue}} [[Pyromancer]] doing a thumbs up with both of its hands. It plays a short sound.

==Trivia==
*This is the only item in the entire game to have an emoji in its name.

